1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,720
None at all.

2
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:03,761
He is perfectly amiable.

3
00:00:04,568 --> 00:00:05,849
Yours sincerely, etc.

4
00:00:06,415 --> 00:00:09,235
but I am sure it will
be too much for Kitty.

5
00:00:09,826 --> 00:00:11,041
She did not choose it

6
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,429
Have not you always hated him?

7
00:00:14,235 --> 00:00:15,363
she would go.

8
00:00:15,910 --> 00:00:17,282
But who was your mother?

9
00:00:18,194 --> 00:00:19,348
I guessed as much.

10
00:00:20,344 --> 00:00:22,548
For the liveliness
of your mind, I did.

11
00:00:23,232 --> 00:00:24,549
cried Elizabeth

12
00:00:25,337 --> 00:00:28,375
I believed you to be wishing,
expecting my addresses.

13
00:00:28,768 --> 00:00:30,574
and what can he have to say?
